The organisation exercises its incident management process, so that the people know what to do and the notifications can be made within the deadlines.

== How to decide if this control is required

This control is required when the organisation must report incidents or vulnerabilities to authorities, or when it runs services that are critical to its customers.

== How to implement

Hold an incident response exercise at least once a year. Use a realistic scenario, for example a ransomware attack or an actively exploited vulnerability in a product. Record the lessons learned, and update the incident management process. The exercise record is created in the incident register.

